        "subject": "=Thank you for your honesty, {{ $('Score Feedback').item.json.firstName }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1f2937;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px\"><p>Hi {{ $('Score Feedback').item.json.firstName }},</p><p>Thank you for telling us — I'm sorry we didn't get it right this time.</p><p>I've personally read your feedback and someone from our team will be in touch shortly to make it right. If you'd like to tell us more in the meantime, just reply to this email.</p><p style=\"margin-top:32px;color:#6b7280;font-size:13px\">{{ $('Config').first().json.businessName }}</p></div>",
