    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Customer Feedback Router\nA 2-question feedback form that sends happy customers to Google to leave a review — and sends unhappy customers straight to you, so you can fix things privately.\n\n### Setup\n1. Create a sheet tab named **Feedback** with the headers in `sheet-Feedback.csv`.\n2. Fill in **Config** (emails, sheet ID, Google review link).\n3. Pick your **Google Sheets** credential (*Log Feedback*) and **SMTP** credential (4 email nodes).\n4. Activate, then copy the **Production URL** from *Feedback Form*. Send it after every job/visit (or put it on receipts as a QR code).\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 417,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
